    "body": "Because the existing text was wrong after we changed the execution mode values. This is about the tag of the resulting capability not how the mode is encoded in YMODER or the raw in-memory format. Right now it expands to writes \"0\" to x1 for cap mode, but it will have a valid tag so should be \"1\"\n\nGood catch! I completely missed this since I mostly looked at the ASCIIdoc source rather than the PDF.",
