    "body": "Hmm I feel like we had a discussion about this a long time ago and we decided there is no need to include the extra AND with the tag when you give it an input that you can't really meaningfully use. \r\nAdditionally, allowing it to behave \"as if valid\" for untagged could potentially allow it to be used with YBLD (not that I see that as being something particularly useful).",
